-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Roadkill doused in syrup.</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/a/a2/Roadkill_doused_in_syrup..png/revision/latest?cb=20210210192831\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Roadkill doused in syrup.\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/a/a2/Roadkill_doused_in_syrup..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20210210192831\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/a/a2/Roadkill_doused_in_syrup..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20210210192831 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/a/a2/Roadkill_doused_in_syrup..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/536?cb=20210210192831 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Roadkill doused in syrup.\" width=\"270\" height=\"152\" data-image-key=\"Roadkill_doused_in_syrup..png\" data-image-name=\"Roadkill doused in syrup..png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"series\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Series</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Series_6\" title=\"Series 6\">6</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"episode\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Episode</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">7</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"winner\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Winner</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Russell_Howard\" title=\"Russell Howard\">Russell Howard</a></div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Episode Guide</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\">← Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next →</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\"><a href=\"/wiki/We_met_at_mealtimes.\" title=\"We met at mealtimes.\">We met at mealtimes.</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/What_kind_of_pictures%3F\" title=\"What kind of pictures?\">What kind of pictures?</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><i><b>Roadkill doused in syrup.</b></i> is the seventh episode of <a href=\"/wiki/Series_6\" title=\"Series 6\">Series 6</a> of <i><a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster\" title=\"Taskmaster\">Taskmaster</a></i> and was first broadcast on <a href=\"/wiki/Dave\" title=\"Dave\">Dave</a> on 13 June 2018. The episode was won by <a href=\"/wiki/Russell_Howard\" title=\"Russell Howard\">Russell Howard</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Episode_title\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode title</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Alternate_titles\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Alternate titles</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Episode_breakdown\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode breakdown</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#External_links\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">External links</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_title\">Episode title</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode title\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Roadkill_doused_in_syrup.?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode title\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>\"Roadkill doused in syrup\" was how <a href=\"/wiki/Alice_Levine\" title=\"Alice Levine\">Alice Levine</a> described one of the objects in the box, in the <a href=\"/wiki/Draw_a_picture_of_the_contents_of_this_box\" title=\"Draw a picture of the contents of this box\">Draw a picture of the contents of this box</a> task. The baseball in the title card was one of the options for balls in the <a href=\"/wiki/Knock_the_bails_off_the_stumps\" title=\"Knock the bails off the stumps\">Knock the bails off the stumps</a> task.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Alternate_titles\">Alternate titles</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Roadkill_doused_in_syrup.?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>On Denmark's TV2 Play streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Trafikdræbt dyr dyppet i sirup', which translates as 'Roadkill dipped in syrup'.</li>\n<li>On Finland's MTV Katsomo streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Siirapilla valeltu maantieraato', which translates as 'Roadkill drizzled in syrup'.<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_breakdown\">Episode breakdown</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Roadkill_doused_in_syrup.?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mbox\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;wrapper\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;header\">Spoilers!</div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;text mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-spoilers\">This section contains spoilers.</div><span class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;close mw-customtoggle-spoilers\" title=\"Dismiss\"></span></div></div></div>\n<table class=\"tmtable\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"tmtableheader\">\n<th>Task\n</th>\n<th>Description\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Alice_Levine\" title=\"Alice Levine\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Alice Levine</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Asim_Chaudhry\" title=\"Asim Chaudhry\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Asim Chaudhry</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Liza_Tarbuck\" title=\"Liza Tarbuck\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Liza Tarbuck</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Russell_Howard\" title=\"Russell Howard\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Russell Howard</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Tim_Vine\" title=\"Tim Vine\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Tim Vine</span></a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Scariest_thing_from_their_kitchen\" title=\"Scariest thing from their kitchen\">1</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Prize:</b> Scariest thing from their kitchen.\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Knock_the_bails_off_the_stumps\" title=\"Knock the bails off the stumps\">2</a>\n</td>\n<td>Knock the bails off the stumps. You've got a maximum of one over. You must make your attempts from behind this stump. No stumps may be moved.\n</td>\n<td>0\n</td>\n<td>0\n</td>\n<td>DQ\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"2\" class=\"tmtablerow\"><a href=\"/wiki/Draw_a_picture_of_the_contents_of_this_box\" title=\"Draw a picture of the contents of this box\">3</a>\n</td>\n<td>Draw a picture of the contents of this box. You may not open the box or look inside.\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><small><i><b>Bonus:</b> Name the person represented by the contents of the box.</i></small>\n</td>\n<td><small>0</small>\n</td>\n<td><small>0</small>\n</td>\n<td><small>0</small>\n</td>\n<td><small>1</small>\n</td>\n<td><small>1</small>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/wiki/Write_down_as_many_obscure_animals_as_possible\" title=\"Write down as many obscure animals as possible\">4</a>\n</td>\n<td>Write down as many obscure animals as possible.\n</td>\n<td>–\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>–\n</td>\n<td><b>3</b>\n</td>\n<td>–\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><b>Team:</b> Guess the animals your teammate has on their list. Your teammate must only use mime. They may not write anything down or show you the list.\n</td>\n<td><b>3</b>\n</td>\n<td>-\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>-\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Tuck_as_many_items_from_the_kitchen_inside_the_sweatband_as_possible\" title=\"Tuck as many items from the kitchen inside the sweatband as possible\">5</a>\n</td>\n<td>Wearing this sweatband around your head at all times, tuck as many items from the kitchen inside the sweatband as possible. Then make a pancake with a diameter of at least 9 inches. Then eat the whole pancake. Most kitchen items successfully kept within the sweatband wins.\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Get_an_egg_as_close_to_the_centre_of_the_target_as_possible\" title=\"Get an egg as close to the centre of the target as possible\">6</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Live:</b> Get an egg as close to the centre of the target as possible. You must stand on the spot when taking your turn. You must ROLL two of the eggs. The person whose egg is furthest from the centre of the target after each round is eliminated.\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtabletotal\">\n<th colspan=\"2\">Total\n</th>\n<td>14\n</td>\n<td>15\n</td>\n<td>17\n</td>\n<td class=\"tmtablewinner\"><b>21</b>\n</td>\n<td>20\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video\">Video</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Video\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" d